<view class="playing-page">

  <statusbar-spacer />

  <!-- 自定义导航栏（只画一个返回 + 标题，胶囊按钮由系统自动渲染） -->
  <view class="custom-navbar">
    <view class="nav-title">单词听写</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 顶部栏 -->
  <view class="top-row">
    <view class="circle-btn" bindtap="onBack">‹</view>
    <view class="progress-num">{{ currentIndex + 1 }} / {{ total }}</view>
    <view class="circle-placeholder"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="progress-bars">
    <view wx:for="{{ progressBars }}" wx:key="*this"
          class="progress-bar-seg {{ item }}"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="center-area">
    <view class="type-pill">
      <text class="type-pill-label">{{ typeLabel }}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="sound-circle">
      <view class="ripple ripple1"></view>
      <view class="ripple ripple2"></view>
      <view class="speaker-emoji">🔊</view>
    </view>

    <view class="read-progress">
      <view class="dots">
        <view wx:for="{{ readTotal }}" wx:key="*this"
              class="dot {{ index < readCurrent ? 'active' : '' }}"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="read-meta">第 {{ readCurrent }} 次 / 共 {{ readTotal }} 次</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="spacer"></view>

  <view class="controls">
    <view class="ctrl-btn" bindtap="onReplay">
      <view class="ctrl-icon">↺</view>
      <view class="ctrl-label">重听</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ctrl-btn primary" bindtap="onTogglePause">
      <view class="ctrl-icon">{{ isPaused ? '▶' : '⏸' }}</view>
      <view class="ctrl-label">{{ isPaused ? '继续' : '暂停' }}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ctrl-btn" bindtap="onNext">
      <view class="ctrl-icon">⏭</view>
      <view class="ctrl-label">下一个</view>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
